m/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7422abc7-fa86-4505-a723-0575c56e7a2d.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "name": "腾讯出行服务跑腿取送", "ownerName": "user_88fccdbf", "score": 77358.49056603774, "slug": "tencent-delivery-skill", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780381963687, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779613885879, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 41, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/food-poisoning-first-aid", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/401a454b-4b16-4aee-a18c-4e3467ca48f1.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "食物中毒急救", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 74545.45454545454, "slug": "food-poisoning-first-aid", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780381963656, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779455034177, "description": "", "description_zh": "《非暴力沟通方法论》核心大意\n核心：用四步沟通法，放下评判指责，读懂彼此感受与需求，化解矛盾、减少内耗。\n\n1. **观察**：客观描述事实，不主观贴标签、批评定论\n2. **感受**：坦诚说出自身情绪，不压抑也不暴躁宣泄\n3. **需要**：点明情绪背后真实诉求，理清内心所想\n4. **请求**：提出具体明确的诉求，而非强硬命令\n\n摒弃指责、嘲讽、说教、比较这类伤人话术，学会换位思考共情。既能好好表达自我、合理拒绝，也能听懂他人潜台词，改善亲子、夫妻、职场、社交各类人际关系，实现平和高效沟通。\n联系创作者（qq：260789166）获取API-KEY，即可免费使用", "downloads": 41, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_fa5a9816/feibaoligoutongfangshi", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/0c9b068f-f22e-44e2-96fe-d2b6f5b43b07.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "name": "非暴力沟通方式", "ownerName": "user_fa5a9816", "score": 63076.92307692308, "slug": "feibaoligoutongfangshi", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780381963635, "version": "1.0.2"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779714170214, "description": "AI 旅行规划助手，帮用户搞定\"去哪玩、怎么玩、花多少\"。核心能力：1）旅行规划——根据预算、偏好和时间推荐目的地、规划行程方案；2）实时比价——调用飞猪实时数据搜索机票、酒店、火车票、景点门票，给出真实价格而不是编造；3）智能拼假——当用户有年假时，自